        <mxCell id="risks" value="&lt;b&gt;Discovery findings / risks&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• MySQL 5.7 end-of-life · Spring Boot 2.7 / Java 11&lt;br&gt;• plaintext secrets in .env, DB port published&lt;br&gt;• -Xmx2g heap &amp;gt; 1g container limit (OOM risk)&lt;br&gt;• no index on transactions.booking_date (slow report)&lt;br&gt;• batch failures invisible, single host, no TLS, no backups" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
